  { key: 'srs-math', prompt: `The SRS overhaul: Services/SRSEngine.swift FSRS-4.5 formulas (initial stability/difficulty, mean reversion, recall/lapse stability, retrievability curve, interval computation, forecast), Models/LearningCard.swift CardProgress.recordReview + legacy SM-2 migration correctness (both directions of the easeFactor<->difficulty map), day-rollover of newCardsIntroducedToday/todayReviewedCount, previewIntervals consistency with what recordReview would actually schedule, relearn-queue behavior in Views/LearnView.swift (re-insertion position, exit condition, session completion when relearn items remain), daily new-card budget accounting (double-count on relearn? decrement on skip?), reviewForecast off-by-one on day boundaries.` },
